WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.687
Constraints are powerful but timing matters If you
add a strict rule

00:00:05.701 --> 00:00:11.556
before understanding legacy data valid historical
exceptions may be blocked or the migration may fail

00:00:13.311 --> 00:00:20.416
Profile first Resolve existing violations Confirm

00:00:20.443 --> 00:00:26.132
the business rule and its owner Then add the
constraint and monitor future

00:00:26.145 --> 00:00:26.566
data
